# The win-64 release leg runs .github/scripts/w2-*.sh straight out of
# actions/checkout@v4 through Isabelle's bundled Cygwin bash.  Today
# windows-latest leaves core.autocrlf off and the scripts arrive with LF, so the
# leg is green -- but that is a runner-image default, not a guarantee, and a
# CRLF `set -euo pipefail\r` fails Cygwin bash before it does anything.  Pin it.
*.sh text eol=lf
